<section class="sec" id="why-v3" style="background:#f8fafc">
  <div style="max-width:1300px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2rem">

    <!-- Split header -->
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:4rem;margin-bottom:3rem">
      <div style="flex:1">
        <h2 class="sh fi" style="text-align:left;margin:0">Why Partner with us?</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:1.5rem;padding-top:.4rem">
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--mgrey);line-height:1.8;margin:0">We help pharmaceutical importers source qualified products, meet regulatory requirements, and ship with certainty, without the complexity of managing multiple suppliers.</p>
        <!-- Nav buttons -->
        <div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem">
          <button onclick="whyScroll(-1)" style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .2s ease" onmouseover="this.style.background='#0d9488';this.style.borderColor='#0d9488'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#fff';this.style.borderColor='#cbd5e1'">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button onclick="whyScroll(1)" style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid #0B3030;background:#0B3030;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:all .2s ease" onmouseover="this.style.background='#0d9488';this.style.borderColor='#0d9488'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#0B3030';this.style.borderColor='#0B3030'">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scrollable cards track -->
    <div id="why-track" style="display:flex;gap:1.25rem;overflow-x:auto;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;padding-bottom:.5rem">
    <style>#why-track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}</style>

    <div class="why-grid fade-in" style="display:contents">

      <!-- Card 01 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"/><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v6M4.22 4.22l4.24 4.24m5.08 0l4.24-4.24M1 12h6m6 0h6M4.22 19.78l4.24-4.24m5.08 0l4.24 4.24"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">01.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Reliable Manufacturing Network</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Every product V3 sources comes from a verified network of WHO-GMP certified manufacturers. These are not directory listings; every facility entered our network through direct professional relationships built over 15 years in pharmaceutical regulatory affairs. When you place an order, the manufacturer behind it has already been evaluated for compliance, documentation capability, and supply reliability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 02 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26H22l-5.45 3.96 2.09 6.26L12 14.1l-5.45 3.96 2.09-6.26L2 8.26h6.91L12 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">02.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Strict Vendor Selection Process</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Not every WHO-GMP certified facility meets V3's sourcing standards. Before any manufacturer enters our network, we evaluate their certification status, production capability, documentation track record, and quality systems. This process protects every buyer; you receive a product backed by a facility we have already vetted, not one we are trying for the first time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 03 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">03.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Regulatory Documentation Support</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Our in-house regulatory affairs team prepares every document your importing authority requires: CTD/ACTD dossiers, COPP, Free Sale Certificates, country-specific labelling and artwork. This work is done before your order ships, not after a customs query forces the issue. Documentation failures at the border are what V3 was specifically built to prevent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 04 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 3c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3s-1.34 3-3 3-3-1.34-3-3 1.34-3 3-3zm0 14.2c-2.5 0-4.71-1.28-6-3.22.03-1.99 4-3.08 6-3.08 1.99 0 5.97 1.09 6 3.08-1.29 1.94-3.5 3.22-6 3.22z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">04.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Competitive Pricing on Every Order</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Because V3 sources from multiple verified manufacturers, you receive pricing options instead of a single take-it-or-leave-it quote. Every quotation includes unit cost, manufacturer source, lead time, and documentation status. Full information before you commit. No hidden charges, no revisions after the order is placed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 05 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M13 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V9z"/><polyline points="13 2 13 9 20 9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">05.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Logistics & Shipment Coordination</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Every shipment is coordinated from manufacturer to destination with GDP-compliant packaging, freight management, and customs clearance support handled by our team. Documentation is complete before dispatch, not assembled in response to a delay. Your order moves when it is supposed to, with everything it needs to clear.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 06 -->
      <div class="why-card" style="flex:0 0 300px;min-height:320px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;transition:flex .4s ease,min-height .3s ease">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:auto">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H8a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto">
          <p style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.07);margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1">06.</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B3030;margin:0 0 .75rem 0;line-height:1.35">Customer-Focused Export Coordination</h3>
          <p class="wc-desc" style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease">Every order at V3 is managed by a dedicated team from the moment your inquiry arrives to the moment your shipment is delivered. Sourcing, documentation, freight, and customs coordination are handled under one roof with no handoffs between departments. You have a single point of contact who knows your order, your market, and your documentation requirements throughout the entire process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- end why-grid -->
    </div><!-- end why-track -->
  </div><!-- end container -->

  <style>
    .why-card:hover .wc-desc{max-height:600px!important}
    .why-card:hover{min-height:480px!important}
  </style>

  <script>
    function whyScroll(dir){
      var t=document.getElementById('why-track');
      t.scrollBy({left:dir*320,behavior:'smooth'});
    }
  </script>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--off-white);padding:0">
  <div style="padding:5rem 2rem 3rem;text-align:center">
    <h2 style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,2.8rem);font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 1rem 0">Our Services</h2>
    
  </div>

  <div style="padding:0 2rem 5rem;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto">
    
    <!-- Service 01 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:1;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 1">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">01</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Pharmaceutical Export Operations</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">From your initial inquiry to final delivery, we coordinate every stage of the pharmaceutical export process. Our team manages communication, order coordination, documentation flow, and shipment execution from a single point of contact.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Inquiry-based product sourcing across therapeutic categories</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>WHO-GMP certified manufacturer network</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>GDP-compliant packaging and handling for all shipments</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Sample export coordination with no regulatory hurdles at origin</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Smooth domestic transportation from manufacturer to port of export</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Pre-shipment quality inspection at dispatch point</span></li></ul></div></div>
    <!-- Service 02 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:2;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/webp;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 2">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">02</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Regulatory & Dossier Preparation</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">Our in-house regulatory affairs team prepares every dossier and submission document your importing authority requires. Documentation is prepared and reviewed before the export process begins, supporting a smoother regulatory review.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>CTD/ACTD dossier preparation for multiple markets</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Product registration support</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Country-specific labelling and artwork compliance</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Free Sale Certificate, COPP, and COA preparation</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>In-house review of all documentation before submission</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Ongoing regulatory updates for target markets</span></li></ul></div></div>
    <!-- Service 03 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:3;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/webp;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 3">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">03</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Export Documentation Support</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">Every shipment is supported by a complete export documentation package aligned with destination market requirements.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Certificate of Analysis (COA)</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Certificate of Pharmaceutical Product (COPP)</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Free Sale Certificate</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Packing list, commercial invoice, and shipping documentation</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Market-specific import compliance documents</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Complete documentation package verified before dispatch</span></li></ul></div></div>
    <!-- Service 04 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:4;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 4">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">04</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Global Product Sourcing</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">Tell us what you need, and we'll identify the most suitable manufacturing partner based on your product, regulatory, and market requirements. Every sourcing recommendation is backed by verified manufacturer credentials and documentation support.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Finished formulations across multiple therapeutic categories</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>API sourcing on inquiry</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Verified manufacturer credentials available on request</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Transparent, competitive pricing with fast quotation turnaround</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Flexible MOQ depending on product and manufacturer</span></li></ul></div></div>
    <!-- Service 05 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:5;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 5">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">05</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Supply Chain & Logistics Coordination</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">We coordinate the full logistics chain from the manufacturing facility to your destination market, helping keep shipments on schedule while meeting international shipping requirements.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Freight coordination and carrier selection</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Temperature-sensitive and cold chain packaging where required</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Customs clearance support at origin</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>End-to-end shipment tracking</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Domestic logistics managed from manufacturer facility to export port</span></li></ul></div></div>
    <!-- Service 06 -->
    <div style="position:sticky;top:88px;height:520px;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48% 52%;cursor:pointer;z-index:6;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)">
      <img src="data:image/avif;base64," style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block" alt="Service 6">
      <div style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;color:#fff;overflow-y:auto">
        <span style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:3rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);line-height:1;margin-bottom:0.3rem">06</span>
        <div style="font-family:var(--hf);font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:700">Market Entry Guidance</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 0.8rem 0">Before you commit to a product or market, we help you understand what regulatory pathway applies, what documentation your authority requires, and whether your product is viable for that market. This advisory happens before sourcing begins.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.4rem"><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Regulatory pathway assessment for your target market</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Documentation requirements identified before order placement</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Product viability check against destination market standards</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Guidance on dossier format and health authority expectations</span></li><li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)"><span style="color:var(--teal);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0">↳</span><span>Pre-order compliance review to avoid delays later</span></li></ul></div></div></section>
<!-- FINAL CTA + FORM -->

